WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.075
Split each unit into equal parts, then count from zero.

2
00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:09.827
Each unit is split into four quarters. P is three quarters right of zero.

3
00:00:10.506 --> 00:00:14.681
Negative three quarters is three quarters to the left of zero.

4
00:00:24.327 --> 00:00:29.077
Negative one and a quarter: past negative one, and one more quarter left.
